,"SI":24,"SK":25,"FI":26,"SE":27},"label":{"EU27_2020":"European Union - 27 countries (from 2020)","BE":"Belgium","BG":"Bulgaria","CZ":"Czechia","DK":"Denmark","DE":"Germany","EE":"Estonia","IE":"Ireland","EL":"Greece","ES":"Spain","FR":"France","HR":"Croatia","IT":"Italy","CY":"Cyprus","LV":"Latvia","LT":"Lithuania","LU":"Luxembourg","HU":"Hungary","MT":"Malta","NL":"Netherlands","AT":"Austria","PL":"Poland","PT":"Portugal","RO":"Romania","SI":"Slovenia","SK":"Slovakia","FI":"Finland","SE":"Sweden"}}},"time":{"label":"Time","category":{"index":{"2010":0,"2011":1,"2012":2,"2013":3,"2014":4,"2015":5,"2016":6,"2017":7,"2018":8,"2019":9,"2020":10,"2021":11,"2022":12,"2023":13,"2024":14,"2025":15},"label":{"2010":"2010","2011":"2011","2012":"2012","2013":"2013","2014":"2014","2015":"2015","2016":"2016","2017":"2017","2018":"2018","2019":"2019","2020":"2020","2021":"2021","2022":"2022","2023":"2023","2024":"2024","2025":"2025"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"EN","description":"<p>The Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices (HICP) measures price changes of various consumer goods and services over time (inflation). This dataset&nbsp;comprises:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li>the average index, which is the average of the monthly HICP indices in a calendar year, and&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>the annual average rate of change, which is the average of the monthly consumer price indices over a calendar year compared to the average of the monthly consumer price indices over the previous calendar year</li></ul><p>Please note that this dataset is discontinued and replaced by <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/bookmark/f7a8b7e0-9b0e-4652-a82b-ad4ffc058b1b?lang=en&amp;createdAt=2026-05-20T13:25:22Z\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">prc_hicp_ainr</a></p>","id":"PRC_HICP_AIND","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"PRC_HICP_AIND","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"59.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2015-11-16T10:20:47+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_X